{
  "$comment": "Design system of the graph explorer page (FTR-TRC-014; ADR-TRC-025: DEC-TRC-084, DEC-TRC-091; structure of ADR-TRC-002: DEC-TRC-009, DEC-TRC-010, RQ-TRC-018). Three tiers, as the performance center's: global holds the only raw values; semantic names a role and refers to a global token; component refers to a semantic token. graph.py writes semantic tokens as --s-<name> and component tokens as --c-<name>; the page's CSS and script use those only. The values are copied from agnos-perf-center/assets/tokens.json (owner's option A, 2026-11-23: no file shared between the two skills), light theme only (FTR-TRC-014 leaves a dark theme out). Node types keep the performance center's surfaces (Okabe-Ito hues for FTR to TASK, indigo for functions, slate for files, red for undefined IDs) and gain one type-*-text token each (DEC-TRC-091), a darker shade of the same hue reaching at least 4.5:1 on surface, surface-subtle and surface-selected (RQ-TRC-157): measured 4.76 (FTR, the Okabe-Ito blue itself) to 9.51 (sections). Sections (SEC), absent from the performance center, take slate-500 as surface and slate-700 as text.",
